  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building justice and peace through CLIMATE ACTION in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CLIMATE ACTION will empower young people to promote climate mitigating policies and create awareness on climate change. The primary target group will be marginalised youth aged 15-30, particularly young persons with disabilities and young women. Peacemaker Climate Clubs will through campaigns create awareness at local and national level. Through dialogue with the county government, the groups will follow up on the implementation of National Climate Change Action Plan &amp; achieving the targets under Nationally Determined Contribution to the Paris Agreement.</narrative>
  </description>
